# Obsidian vault I/O

**Brain:** `D:\Obsidian\Obsidian\00_Brain`  
**Project vaults:** `D:\Obsidian\Obsidian\40_VSCode\<Project>\`  
**Canonical sync:** Official **Obsidian Sync** (no public API — files on disk are SSOT on each device).

## Operational memory (Bridge, Features, Open Loops)

Use **full vault access** when the session needs it — not only the git-mirror subset.

| Context | Preferred | Also OK |
|---------|-----------|---------|
| **Desk** | Native `Read` / `Grep` / `Write` / `StrReplace` on `D:\Obsidian\...` | **Obsidian MCP** on the same `D:\` paths (reads/writes what Official Sync maintains) |
| **Cloud / iPhone** | Obsidian MCP registered in **Cursor Dashboard** (when you expose full vault) | Native `Read` / `Grep` on `vault-petralian` clone + Obsidian Git push for write-back |

**Retired:** VPS CouchDB / `obsidian-sync-mcp` / `vault-mcp.petralian.com` — do not wire these for vault access.

## Tool choice (desk)

| Action | Tool |
|--------|------|
| Read / search | Native `Read` / `Grep` **or** Obsidian MCP (`petralian-obsidian`, `obsidian-brain`, filesystem MCP on `D:\`) |
| Write / edit | Native `Write` / `StrReplace` **or** Obsidian MCP write tools |
| Repo code | Native workspace tools |

Pick **one** path per turn per file — do not read the same note natively and via MCP in one turn.

## Cloud without `D:\`

1. `repositoryDependencies` → `vault-petralian` for ops subset (Bridge, Features, `_MOC.md`).
2. **Obsidian MCP** (Dashboard) when configured — for full vault parity with desk.
3. URL MCP (OpenSEO, etc.) per `docs/TOKEN-STACK.md`.

Stdio MCP (Context7, Serena) is **desktop-only**.
